          "type": "FVector& PreProjectedOutput )>",
          "default": "[](const FVector&, FVector&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "TUniqueFunction<",
      "docs": "Optional position constraint function. Called during interaction with the new transform origin.\nTo snap the transform to a new position, return as second value, and return true from your lambda.\nNote that returned snap point will be projected onto the current translation origin/axis.\n@return true if constraint point was found and should be used, false to ignore",
